OL,3,GNEWSABake Off star says 'going sober'
OL,4,Ahas been 'glorious'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Great British Bake Off star turned TV
OL,7,Fpresenter says "going sober" and being
OL,8,Falcohol free for nearly three years has
OL,9,Fbeen "glorious".
OL,11,FBriony May Williams, from Bristol, made
OL,12,Fit to the Great British Bake Off
OL,13,Fsemi-finals back in 2018, but went home
OL,14,Fafter she served judges Paul Hollywood
OL,15,Fand Prue Leith "raw pastry" and
OL,16,Fadmitted she used "salt instead of
OL,17,Fsugar".
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
