OL,3,GNEWSABake Off star says 'going sober'
OL,4,Ahas been 'glorious'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWilliams said she decided to make some
OL,7,F"big changes" in her life and go sober
OL,8,Fafter she ended up in hospital at the
OL,9,Fend of 2023 following an "alcohol-heavy
OL,10,F39th birthday".
OL,12,F"Going sober - it's glorious. It's not
OL,13,Falways easy but it's always worth it
OL,14,Fand I feel much more able to cope with
OL,15,Fwhat life throws at me," she added.
